<title>INDIA: India ITC shr falls 5.4 pct on rumours.</title>
<headline>India ITC shr falls 5.4 pct on rumours.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The share of ITC Ltd fell sharply on Indian bourses on Wednesday afternoon sparked by rumours of a tax investigation into the affairs of the tobacco and hotel conglomerate.</p>
<p>The share fell 17.25 rupees, or 5.37 percent, to 304.0 at the Bombay Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
</text>
